WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:32.680
Good morning, everyone.

01:32.690 --> 01:39.160
SIXTH PROFESSOR
HERCULES'S TRAINING

01:33.040 --> 01:37.690
In your training with me, you'll 
be playing a game between covens.

01:39.160 --> 01:41.400
That sounds fun!

01:41.670 --> 01:45.030
I call it the Magic Survival Game.

01:45.260 --> 01:46.500
The rules are simple.

01:46.500 --> 01:49.200
You'll split up into two 
teams and hurl magic

01:49.200 --> 01:52.360
at each other until one 
side is eliminated.

01:52.360 --> 01:53.640
That's scary!

01:53.640 --> 01:57.410
You'll all wear badges like this
to ensure your safety.

01:57.410 --> 01:58.380
It's so cheesy.

01:58.740 --> 02:01.340
It's enchanted with my Metal Magic.

02:01.340 --> 02:05.080
It'll protect you from 
any attack just once.

02:05.080 --> 02:07.000
Really? Wow.

02:07.000 --> 02:09.860
But after that, the badge 
will break, yes sir.

02:09.860 --> 02:12.050
You're to withdraw as soon as it does.

02:12.330 --> 02:14.780
So you're done after one hit.

02:14.780 --> 02:16.390
Sounds fun.

02:16.390 --> 02:18.840
If you win, you pass.

02:18.840 --> 02:22.110
If you lose, you fail. 
Sudden death, yes sir.

02:22.110 --> 02:23.830
Fail?!

02:24.140 --> 02:25.230
That's right.

02:25.230 --> 02:27.370
And if you fail...

02:28.840 --> 02:31.790
you stay at this camp for an extra week!

02:31.790 --> 02:36.510
I'll see you at my place for 24-hour 
strength training, yes sir!

02:37.020 --> 02:39.250
I can't lose.

02:39.930 --> 02:42.290
The whole of Mount Selene 
is the battlefield.

02:42.290 --> 02:44.670
There are no time limits, no sir.

02:45.050 --> 02:47.900
Now, our first match-up is...

02:48.540 --> 02:51.890
Claude Coven versus Hercules Coven!

02:52.430 --> 02:55.850
The teachers are watching 
us from the top of the cliff.

02:56.220 --> 02:57.420
You're right!

02:57.420 --> 03:00.070
I guess this training 
gets a lot of attention.

03:00.930 --> 03:03.570
We're putting our coven's 
reputation on the line.

03:03.570 --> 03:06.040
We can't embarrass ourselves.

03:08.140 --> 03:11.630
Not even after how much you embarrassed 
yourselves at the dance yesterday?

03:12.550 --> 03:13.910
And who are you?

03:13.910 --> 03:15.320
Pardon me.

03:15.320 --> 03:17.080
We're Hercules Coven.

03:17.630 --> 03:20.000
I'm the leader, Korne Phoros.

03:20.000 --> 03:22.040
Go easy on us, yeah?

03:22.530 --> 03:25.000
Hello! Nice to meet you!

03:26.410 --> 03:29.740
I'm sorry. My coven is full of meatheads.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.860
You know how it is,

03:33.060 --> 03:36.020
having to lead a bunch of failures.

03:36.020 --> 03:36.800
Come again?

03:37.410 --> 03:41.940
You came to this camp to score 
points like I did, didn't you?

03:41.940 --> 03:46.360
Why else would you subject yourself 
to this hell when you've already passed?

03:46.780 --> 03:48.160
Ridiculous.

03:48.160 --> 03:49.180
Let's go.

03:50.010 --> 03:53.550
Hey! You're that Aries girl, aren't you?

03:53.550 --> 03:56.130
You gave us all a good laugh 
during training the other day.

03:56.130 --> 04:01.600
You're just dragging everyone 
down. You don't even care.

04:01.600 --> 04:03.630
Just standing there like a decoration.

04:04.650 --> 04:06.270
Oh, did that hurt?

04:06.270 --> 04:08.590
I'm kidding!

04:09.240 --> 04:11.050
Being a decoration would be nice.

04:11.390 --> 04:14.220
I could just stay still my whole life.

04:14.220 --> 04:16.140
I want to become a decoration.

04:21.560 --> 04:25.820
I hate to ruin your party, but could 
you choose your starting positions?

04:26.360 --> 04:27.940
After you.

04:27.940 --> 04:28.780
You don't mind?

04:29.110 --> 04:30.400
Where should we go?

04:32.770 --> 04:35.140
Eh, I don't think it'll matter.

04:39.140 --> 04:41.580
We'll start here, then.

04:45.380 --> 04:47.590
It's a teleportation tool.

04:47.590 --> 04:51.670
The fireworks signal the 
start of the match, yes sir.

04:51.670 --> 04:54.010
Be sure to give it your all!

04:57.400 --> 05:00.700
That teleportation tool is pretty useful.

05:00.700 --> 05:03.140
That Korne, though...

05:03.140 --> 05:04.710
What a jerk, huh?

05:04.710 --> 05:06.730
We probably shouldn't let our guards down.

05:06.730 --> 05:10.050
He got an A in the midterms.

05:10.050 --> 05:12.280
Wow, just like Aria!

05:12.640 --> 05:15.120
We took the same route on the exam, too.

05:15.120 --> 05:18.060
It wasn't just his magical skills. 
He's clever, too.

05:18.060 --> 05:20.260
He has a way with words.

05:20.260 --> 05:22.510
He ordered people around 
like they were pawns.

05:22.510 --> 05:24.980
I don't care what he's like.

05:24.980 --> 05:27.360
All that matters is that we 
take that piece of shit down.

05:27.830 --> 05:30.060
Capella... Are you angry?

05:31.380 --> 05:33.530
I'll take command.

05:33.530 --> 05:35.080
We're going to wreck them.

05:39.130 --> 05:41.120
Game on!

05:44.050 --> 05:47.210
Libra Magic: Eye of Argus.

05:48.560 --> 05:50.580
Ras, do you hear me?

05:50.580 --> 05:53.710
I've linked your hearing 
and vision with mine.

05:54.420 --> 05:57.660
You can see clearly where they are.

05:58.140 --> 06:00.480
Capella's a fool.

06:00.480 --> 06:04.370
The battle began the moment 
we chose our starting positions.

06:04.740 --> 06:08.850
To choose a flat area with 
nowhere to hide is nonsense.

06:09.660 --> 06:11.300
They split up!

06:12.860 --> 06:16.380
You're supposed to act in pairs.

06:16.380 --> 06:20.410
Er, sorry. I lost everyone.

06:20.410 --> 06:21.630
Not a problem.

06:21.630 --> 06:23.860
I know which directions they went.

06:24.160 --> 06:27.490
We'll set out in pairs to hunt them down.

06:27.490 --> 06:30.610
Surround them one at a 
time and pick them off.

06:31.180 --> 06:36.670
With your brawn and my 
brains, we're unstoppable.

06:38.620 --> 06:41.320
Nice! The Virgo's on her own!

06:41.320 --> 06:42.910
There's no one else in the vicinity!

06:42.910 --> 06:44.600
We're going in!

06:44.600 --> 06:46.290
Hold it! Something's off!

06:50.490 --> 06:52.170
Just kidding!

06:57.040 --> 06:59.280
I didn't expect it to work so well.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.890
I thought you were acting individually!

07:01.890 --> 07:05.020
You thought we were dumb 
enough to choose a flat,

07:05.020 --> 07:07.350
open field where we could get caught?

07:08.240 --> 07:10.310
You did, though.

07:10.790 --> 07:15.910
We did that intentionally to make you 
think we weren't working in teams.

07:17.870 --> 07:22.000
Just as we hoped, you came 
to check on our positions.

07:22.000 --> 07:26.260
So after splitting up once, 
we reconvened back here in secret.

07:26.570 --> 07:30.530
I used Cancer Magic to 
make a fake boulder.

07:30.530 --> 07:34.210
And I camouflaged it with Virgo Magic.

07:34.510 --> 07:37.160
Aside from Spica, who was a decoy,

07:37.160 --> 07:38.960
we all hid so that we could surround you

07:38.960 --> 07:41.430
and take you on when 
you let your guard down.

07:41.940 --> 07:45.020
You thought you'd trapped us, 
but you walked into our trap.

07:45.020 --> 07:46.260
Chumps.

07:46.260 --> 07:47.780
That bitch...

07:48.220 --> 07:51.260
Bring it on! I'll mess you up!

07:51.260 --> 07:53.290
Capricorn Magic.

07:58.410 --> 07:59.520
Shit!

08:01.820 --> 08:03.050
Nice!

08:03.050 --> 08:04.390
One down!

08:06.740 --> 08:09.000
I-I surrender.

08:10.990 --> 08:14.600
I never expected you to 
use my trick against me.

08:15.100 --> 08:17.190
Looks like I underestimated you a little.

08:17.940 --> 08:22.320
So that's the Claude Coven 
leader, Capella Capricorn...

08:23.440 --> 08:26.250
What's the plan, Korne?

08:26.250 --> 08:29.420
Relax. They won't get 
away with that again.

08:29.420 --> 08:33.190
Even the strongest wall has a weak spot.

08:33.890 --> 08:37.190
Pick that apart, and we can win.

08:42.290 --> 08:44.120
I'm tired.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.400
Can I take a nap?

08:45.400 --> 08:46.760
We're in the middle of a battle!

08:46.760 --> 08:48.910
This is why the enemy 
keeps underestimating us!

08:48.910 --> 08:50.580
You're so naggy!

08:50.580 --> 08:53.010
It's important to take tactical breaks!

08:54.150 --> 08:56.840
Those two are fighting again.

08:59.240 --> 09:01.980
Keeping watch is such a pain.

09:02.440 --> 09:04.710
Capella's such a try-hard.

09:04.710 --> 09:07.450
I don't want to fight.

09:07.450 --> 09:09.380
I'm hungry.

09:09.380 --> 09:10.600
I should just...

09:11.440 --> 09:13.940
"I want to get hit so I can bail."

09:14.540 --> 09:16.330
Is that what you're thinking?

09:17.470 --> 09:19.410
How could you tell?

09:19.410 --> 09:22.300
I can use Psychic Magic, too.

09:22.940 --> 09:24.730
Just kidding.

09:24.730 --> 09:28.990
I'm just starting to understand 
the way you think a little.

09:29.380 --> 09:33.660
Plus, training is a pain 
in the butt for me, too.

09:33.660 --> 09:37.320
I thought you were a 
train-a-holic crazy person.

09:37.320 --> 09:39.550
That's a nasty way to be seen.

09:39.890 --> 09:43.230
But you're always working so hard.

09:43.230 --> 09:44.380
Why is that?

09:45.730 --> 09:48.650
Because I have a goal, maybe.

09:49.690 --> 09:53.860
I don't know what I should work toward.

09:53.860 --> 09:55.700
I get it.

09:56.080 --> 09:59.410
Not having a goal sucks, too.

10:00.070 --> 10:02.800
But I think there are times when you can

10:02.800 --> 10:06.450
make an effort for someone else's 
sake, if not for your own.

10:09.740 --> 10:11.420
For someone else's sake?

10:13.340 --> 10:15.800
How can you make an 
effort for someone else?

10:16.100 --> 10:17.810
That's nothing but exhausting.

10:17.810 --> 10:19.430
I don't get it.

10:19.890 --> 10:25.270
I've always run away from the things 
I didn't want to do or hated dealing with.

10:25.840 --> 10:31.010
The only time I had fun was when 
I started learning magic with Capella.

10:34.770 --> 10:36.640
I'm hungry...

10:40.620 --> 10:42.060
An apple!

10:43.530 --> 10:46.480
How about we dig in and ambush them?

10:47.060 --> 10:48.790
An ambush might work.

10:54.320 --> 10:56.120
What the hell are you doing?!

10:56.370 --> 10:59.470
Leo Magic: Beast Claw!

11:00.530 --> 11:02.470
L-Leo Magic?!

11:02.830 --> 11:04.180
That leaves...

11:04.850 --> 11:07.310
Ewe has Aries Magic.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.610
Who are you?

11:15.340 --> 11:18.370
That's Ras. One of ours.

11:18.370 --> 11:20.880
Sorry, Capella. They caught me.

11:20.880 --> 11:22.360
They took my wand, too.

11:22.360 --> 11:25.120
What kind of cheap trick is this?

11:26.720 --> 11:29.440
Let me be the one to teach you this time.

11:29.440 --> 11:33.570
You guys always stick together. 
I couldn't find an opening.

11:33.570 --> 11:36.530
So I had to make one 
I could take advantage of.

11:36.790 --> 11:40.390
I used my genius scheme to draw her out.

11:40.720 --> 11:42.080
An apple!

11:42.080 --> 11:45.820
Once she was paralyzed by the 
poisoned apple, we captured her.

11:45.820 --> 11:47.180
Are you a monkey?!

11:47.650 --> 11:51.310
We used Gemini Magic to scan her 
and applied her image to Ras,

11:51.310 --> 11:52.880
who has a similar figure.

11:53.610 --> 11:57.930
You let your guard down, 
believing Ras was Ewe Aries.

11:57.930 --> 12:00.880
You fell right into our trap.

12:01.630 --> 12:04.100
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

12:04.100 --> 12:06.180
How the tables have turned!

12:06.940 --> 12:08.590
Ewe! Smokescreen!

12:08.770 --> 12:11.850
Aries Magic: Smokescreen!

12:17.220 --> 12:17.930
Hit them!

12:23.760 --> 12:25.140
They got away.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.650
That's fine.

12:27.650 --> 12:31.230
The very presence of a 
failure slows everyone down.

12:32.190 --> 12:34.110
Capella...

12:34.110 --> 12:35.570
Ewe...

12:41.920 --> 12:43.880
We don't have any time to waste.

12:43.880 --> 12:46.460
They're going to be right behind us.

12:46.460 --> 12:47.390
Okay.

12:49.240 --> 12:52.110
Capella's definitely mad at me.

12:52.660 --> 12:54.390
I fell for such a silly trap.

12:54.800 --> 12:57.380
I wasted everyone's efforts.

12:57.830 --> 13:00.170
Spica and the others must be angry, too.

13:01.220 --> 13:03.790
I'm the only one not 
taking this seriously.

13:03.790 --> 13:05.770
That's why I got targeted.

13:06.660 --> 13:08.720
Korne's right.

13:09.470 --> 13:11.400
I'm useless.

13:13.730 --> 13:17.900
I wonder if Capella thinks so, too.

13:18.430 --> 13:19.590
That would hurt.

13:21.500 --> 13:24.660
I entered Diana because 
I wanted to be with Capella.

13:25.580 --> 13:30.360
She's just going to get 
sick of me and move on.

13:33.430 --> 13:36.340
What are you moping for? 
That's not like you.

13:36.340 --> 13:37.920
Switch gears.

13:37.920 --> 13:40.500
We need to come up with a way 
to regain the upper hand.

13:40.500 --> 13:42.150
You aren't mad at me?

13:42.150 --> 13:43.970
Of course I'm mad.

13:43.970 --> 13:45.890
You fell for such a stupid trap.

13:46.230 --> 13:47.430
But I'm not...

13:47.930 --> 13:48.770
Look out!

13:51.730 --> 13:52.510
Capella!

13:52.510 --> 13:53.550
Are you hurt?!

13:54.080 --> 13:55.490
I'm fine.

13:56.600 --> 13:59.090
It must be the badge's effect.

13:59.490 --> 14:01.970
But that's it for me.

14:01.970 --> 14:03.140
No!

14:03.140 --> 14:05.940
Such noble self-sacrifice.

14:05.940 --> 14:09.100
Friendship is a wonderful thing.

14:09.400 --> 14:14.440
But if your goal is to win, 
you ought to have survived

14:14.440 --> 14:16.990
instead of that liability.

14:17.290 --> 14:18.910
He's right.

14:19.680 --> 14:21.860
There's no reason I should remain.

14:22.500 --> 14:23.950
Idiot.

14:23.950 --> 14:28.710
Do you really think I would have 
sacrificed myself for no reason?

14:29.140 --> 14:32.770
Ewe can crush all of you.

14:32.770 --> 14:34.420
That's my calculation.

14:36.890 --> 14:39.730
Say what? Are you serious?

14:40.170 --> 14:42.080
Show them what you can really do!

14:42.080 --> 14:47.890
I know you've got more 
talent than anyone, Ewe!

14:44.200 --> 14:47.890
Look at me! Isn't it awesome?

14:48.630 --> 14:52.730
You've always been my inspiration.

14:53.750 --> 14:55.850
I'm counting on you.

14:56.810 --> 14:58.330
Your inspiration?

14:59.550 --> 15:00.970
Me?

15:01.940 --> 15:03.090
Well, that's that.

15:03.090 --> 15:06.000
There's no way you're 
winning against us four-to-one.

15:06.000 --> 15:08.680
Especially not that decoration there.

15:08.680 --> 15:12.410
Capella, I thought you 
had at least some brains.

15:12.410 --> 15:14.380
Turns out you're an awful 
judge of character.

15:14.680 --> 15:17.100
What a dumb girl you turned out to be.

15:19.010 --> 15:21.840
Ras, put her out of her misery.

15:21.840 --> 15:23.480
Aight.

15:24.640 --> 15:27.870
I never knew Capella saw me that way.

15:28.190 --> 15:30.810
But I think there are times when you can

15:30.810 --> 15:34.750
make an effort for someone else's 
sake, if not for your own.

15:43.190 --> 15:45.210
Where did this massive flame come from?

15:45.830 --> 15:49.420
She believes in me.

15:49.970 --> 15:51.900
I want to live up to her expectations!

15:53.400 --> 15:55.440
Don't diss Capella.

15:56.020 --> 15:57.690
What happened to her?

15:57.690 --> 15:59.400
She's like a different person.

16:00.680 --> 16:03.320
Claude Coven's backs are against the wall.

16:03.320 --> 16:05.350
Do you think they can turn it around?

16:05.350 --> 16:06.770
No way.

16:06.770 --> 16:09.630
It's one against four. 
She's just going to get surrounded.

16:09.630 --> 16:12.520
No, I wouldn't be so sure.

16:16.230 --> 16:19.080
What the hell was that huge flame?

16:19.080 --> 16:20.370
Was that a fluke?

16:20.670 --> 16:25.370
Maasym, you use Aries Magic, too. 
Try your firepower against hers!

16:25.370 --> 16:26.470
On it.

16:26.800 --> 16:29.940
These guys failed the midterm.

16:29.940 --> 16:32.210
They're idiots, but 
they're plenty capable.

16:32.760 --> 16:34.460
We're lost!

16:34.460 --> 16:36.170
We're back at the entrance!

16:36.170 --> 16:38.890
Bro, how do we get out of here?

16:39.190 --> 16:43.360
If I'd taken their route, 
we all would have passed together.

16:45.220 --> 16:48.520
Maasym's firepower is among 
the best in our year.

16:48.810 --> 16:52.780
Aries Magic: Prominence Blow!

16:52.200 --> 16:52.770
It's huge!

16:53.570 --> 16:57.070
Aries Magic: Prominence Blow.

17:10.540 --> 17:12.090
What's wrong with her?!

17:12.410 --> 17:15.060
What kind of first-year has 
that kind of firepower?!

17:15.600 --> 17:17.020
Three more to go.

17:17.940 --> 17:20.340
I never knew that girl 
could make such a blaze!

17:20.340 --> 17:22.030
I want it on me!

17:22.030 --> 17:26.440
Aries Magic turns magic 
power into volleys of fire.

17:26.440 --> 17:30.790
That girl possesses an 
incredible power reserve.

17:30.790 --> 17:34.660
She might have what it takes to 
be the top student in her year.

17:37.600 --> 17:40.350
I thought she just slept all the time.

17:40.350 --> 17:43.730
I never knew that kid had 
that kind of hidden skill.

17:43.730 --> 17:46.170
It didn't look like she 
was trying to hide it.

17:46.170 --> 17:49.170
Her dormant talent must 
have been awakened.

17:49.170 --> 17:52.590
Ewe's fighting for the sake of our coven!

17:53.030 --> 17:55.220
You can do it, Ewe!

17:55.530 --> 17:57.890
Surround and pincer her 
from three directions!

17:57.890 --> 17:59.710
Cujam, hit her from a distance.

17:59.710 --> 18:02.220
The moment you see an opening, 
Ras, finish her off!

18:02.560 --> 18:05.260
Aries Magic: Volcano Eruption.

18:05.580 --> 18:06.470
She's gone!

18:07.150 --> 18:08.260
Above you!

18:08.260 --> 18:09.090
Fool!

18:09.090 --> 18:11.220
You can't parry in the air!

18:16.230 --> 18:19.440
She used the eruption of 
flame to propel herself!

18:21.670 --> 18:23.160
Two more.

18:26.380 --> 18:27.240
She's fast!

18:27.930 --> 18:29.840
Watch out for a flame attack!

18:32.000 --> 18:34.570
Leo Magic: Elephant Breath!

18:36.940 --> 18:38.470
She blew it out!

18:38.470 --> 18:40.340
A kick from the right! Defend!

18:41.920 --> 18:43.690
That's it, Ras!

18:43.690 --> 18:45.810
I'll keep predicting her moves for you!

18:46.090 --> 18:48.960
Oh, no... Ewe's in trouble.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.350
Is she?

18:50.350 --> 18:53.470
Look at her face. She doesn't 
look like she's in a bind.

18:54.590 --> 18:56.720
My body's so hot.

18:56.720 --> 18:58.990
What is this sensation?

18:59.460 --> 19:03.530
It's like the time I first started 
learning magic with Capella.

19:04.290 --> 19:07.240
The elation of knowing I can 
control magic on a whim...

19:07.240 --> 19:11.130
And the tension of knowing 
I'm fighting for my team.

19:12.510 --> 19:13.810
This is fun!

19:14.760 --> 19:16.270
More heat!

19:16.270 --> 19:18.070
More firepower!

19:18.500 --> 19:21.760
Damn it! She's too fast! I can't keep up!

19:24.270 --> 19:25.460
Korne, I need orders!

19:25.460 --> 19:27.230
Hey! Get away from me!

19:28.720 --> 19:30.270
Aries Magic...

19:31.180 --> 19:35.890
Freaking hell! How could she overwhelm 
me and Ras working together?

19:35.890 --> 19:38.940
She's too powerful! This isn't fair!

19:38.940 --> 19:39.990
Agni!

19:54.440 --> 19:57.300
Holy... She's too strong.

20:03.530 --> 20:05.600
I'm so hungry.

20:05.600 --> 20:09.260
The winner: Claude Coven!

20:11.270 --> 20:13.510
Wow, Ewe!

20:13.510 --> 20:16.160
Did you see that?! 
Those kids are from my coven!

20:16.160 --> 20:17.320
Aren't they just the best?!

20:17.320 --> 20:18.400
That hurts!

20:19.030 --> 20:20.510
Just like a doting dad.

20:22.030 --> 20:24.900
Ewe seemed like she was having fun.

20:25.900 --> 20:29.520
Like when we first started 
learning magic together.

20:30.570 --> 20:36.080
But when our master noticed her talent 
and got too harsh with her training...

20:36.370 --> 20:38.900
Why won't you do as I say?!

20:38.900 --> 20:43.040
Do as I say, and you'll become perfect!

20:43.040 --> 20:45.510
But it's not fun!

20:46.560 --> 20:49.420
Wait! Don't let your talent go to waste!

20:50.190 --> 20:54.590
She ended up hating magic and 
suppressing her capabilities.

20:55.590 --> 21:00.120
I hope she's remembered 
how fun magic can be.

21:00.930 --> 21:02.850
Capella!

21:03.180 --> 21:07.060
I'm so exhausted. I can't move anymore.

21:07.960 --> 21:09.540
Good going!

21:09.540 --> 21:11.430
You could've brought it sooner, though!

21:14.390 --> 21:17.530
Spica was right.

21:19.570 --> 21:24.770
The moment I felt the urge to fight for 
you and the coven, I became motivated.

21:25.490 --> 21:28.170
I've never felt this way before.

21:30.350 --> 21:32.430
My opponent was good, too.

21:32.680 --> 21:35.050
I had to fight with everything I had.

21:35.570 --> 21:38.610
When I won, I was so happy!

21:41.060 --> 21:42.380
That's great to hear.

21:43.520 --> 21:45.730
Now you can put more effort into training.

21:45.730 --> 21:47.650
No way. I don't wanna try.

21:47.650 --> 21:49.290
You haven't changed!

21:49.840 --> 21:52.980
All of Claude Coven passes.

23:27.410 --> 23:29.170
That was Ewe's voice, right?!

23:29.170 --> 23:31.240
What just happened in 
the examination room?!

23:31.240 --> 23:32.500
Next, Spica Virgo.

23:32.500 --> 23:33.010
Yes?!

23:33.010 --> 23:34.410
Now, please remove your clothes.

23:35.320 --> 23:36.940
Next episode: "The Attack"!

23:35.720 --> 23:40.000
EPISODE 10
THE ATTACK

23:36.940 --> 23:39.560
What's about to happen to me?!
